WEBVTT

00:07.665 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:37.025 --> 01:39.025
ADAPTED FROM <i>THE EARLY SPRING</i> ON JJWXC.NET
AUTHOR: GU NIANG BIE KU

01:59.945 --> 02:01.905
<i>You got one word wrong. Retype everything.</i>

02:04.065 --> 02:05.345
<i>Your father scolded you back then.</i>

02:05.425 --> 02:07.745
<i>You got angry and broke the typewriter.</i>

02:10.825 --> 02:13.225
<i>Although your father hit you with a ruler,</i>

02:13.745 --> 02:16.745
<i>he still fixed the typewriter</i>
<i>until three in the morning.</i>

02:17.585 --> 02:19.905
<i>He even had me lie to you</i>
<i>and say the nanny fixed it.</i>

03:23.585 --> 03:26.745
THE FIRST PERSON
TO FALL IN LOVE WILL LOSE EVERYTHING

03:28.905 --> 03:31.945
Mr. Luan, you've lost it.

03:33.465 --> 03:37.145
<i>I just want to keep</i>
<i>a professional distance between us.</i>

03:37.705 --> 03:39.225
She can control it.

03:39.305 --> 03:40.545
Why would I lose control?

03:43.065 --> 03:45.625
All right. You didn't lose control.

03:50.985 --> 03:53.305
Oh. I bought a new car.

03:53.385 --> 03:54.945
Help me claim it as expenses.

03:59.305 --> 04:01.345
LIME SUPPLIER DATABASE - EVENT COMPANIES

04:01.425 --> 04:03.305
LIME SUPPLIER DATABASE - PHOTOGRAPHY TEAM

04:03.385 --> 04:04.585
LIME SUPPLIER DATABASE - MEDIA COMPANY

04:04.665 --> 04:06.985
Have you verified the data in this column?

04:12.905 --> 04:14.625
Have a piece of cake first.

04:14.705 --> 04:15.865
Let me help you amend it.

04:20.785 --> 04:21.985
Tao.

04:22.505 --> 04:23.345
Listen to me.

04:23.425 --> 04:28.185
Lowering your boss's expectations
appropriately is also a life hack.

04:28.265 --> 04:29.465
Don't back yourself into a corner.

04:29.545 --> 04:30.545
Lower it more?

04:31.665 --> 04:34.145
I'm already worthless,
and I still have to lower it?

04:34.665 --> 04:36.625
He'll just fire me.

04:41.945 --> 04:46.105
I heard a very important figure
sent you back tonight.

04:49.465 --> 04:50.345
Have you had a new breakthrough?

04:51.505 --> 04:53.345
What are you talking about?

04:54.025 --> 04:57.665
I'm just a rookie
who just stepped out of the tutorial.

04:57.745 --> 04:59.945
I've faced a max-level boss.

05:00.025 --> 05:01.905
An ultimate move from him,
and I'd have died multiple times.

05:01.985 --> 05:03.185
Don't talk nonsense.

05:04.305 --> 05:06.985
Encountering troubles at work is common.

05:07.065 --> 05:09.025
I'll work a bit
to help you out this weekend.

05:09.105 --> 05:09.945
Really?

05:10.585 --> 05:11.705
Thank you.

05:13.305 --> 05:15.505
Tao, I'm worried about you now.

05:16.425 --> 05:20.545
How long can you last walking a tightrope
between your work performance

05:20.625 --> 05:22.105
and your feelings?

05:23.865 --> 05:29.105
Our instructor told us
to maintain a safe distance

05:29.185 --> 05:31.665
if we didn't want to collide
with the car in front.

05:32.225 --> 05:33.185
Your instructor is right.

05:33.265 --> 05:34.265
But did he tell you this?

05:34.865 --> 05:36.305
If you encountered a steep corner,

05:36.905 --> 05:39.625
you panicked and stepped on the gas pedal,

05:39.705 --> 05:43.025
you wouldn't be able to control
whether the car would flip over or not.

05:46.505 --> 05:48.705
It's dangerous. It's too dangerous.

05:54.025 --> 05:55.625
The board has made a decision.

05:55.705 --> 05:57.505
Mr. Lin will be transferred
to the United States.

05:59.865 --> 06:02.545
He wanted me
to win Yueteng back this quickly

06:02.625 --> 06:05.225
because he wanted to go
to the headquarters to give a job report.

06:06.585 --> 06:08.825
Can you focus on yourself?

06:09.625 --> 06:12.505
I heard your appointment
as the interim general manager

06:12.585 --> 06:13.825
will become official soon.

06:14.785 --> 06:16.265
You just heard about it.

06:16.345 --> 06:17.585
Let me know when it is official.

06:18.105 --> 06:20.665
Don't tell me
that you're not interested in a promotion.

06:22.705 --> 06:25.425
You need to handle
the Yueteng project well.

06:25.505 --> 06:26.865
Do it steadily.

06:26.945 --> 06:28.505
Don't cause any unnecessary trouble.

06:29.105 --> 06:32.865
For example, doing some kind
of supplier grading scheme.

06:32.945 --> 06:34.705
Breaking the long-standing custom

06:35.305 --> 06:37.945
means affecting
other people's slice of the pie.

06:38.785 --> 06:39.625
What?

06:40.545 --> 06:42.265
Someone even made complaints to you?

06:43.905 --> 06:45.505
That means my decision is working.

06:46.345 --> 06:49.185
A long-standing custom
doesn't mean it's a good cycle.

06:49.265 --> 06:52.505
What you need to do
is find talents that the company can use.

06:52.585 --> 06:55.985
What I need to do is prevent
financial losses for the company.

07:02.305 --> 07:04.145
LIME SUPPLIER EVALUATION TABLE

07:07.305 --> 07:09.705
Judging from your expression,
is there some kind of good news?

07:11.265 --> 07:14.825
The employee you hired is quite capable
when it comes to execution.

07:15.345 --> 07:17.065
She made something impossible happen.

07:29.865 --> 07:31.785
We'll separate suppliers
into three categories.

07:31.865 --> 07:34.905
Event companies, photography teams,
and media channels.

07:36.385 --> 07:38.145
We will visit these suppliers

07:38.225 --> 07:42.585
and give them a grade
based on various factors.

07:44.545 --> 07:45.945
Take event companies, for example.

07:46.025 --> 07:48.545
We'll rate them in terms of past events,

07:48.625 --> 07:50.905
brand expertise, and cooperation levels.

07:51.705 --> 07:52.985
SUPPLIER RATINGS BASED ON VARIOUS FACTORS

07:53.585 --> 07:54.825
THANK YOU FOR YOUR TIME

07:54.905 --> 07:56.945
We'll continue to refine the details.

08:04.505 --> 08:07.025
Coming here is worth it today.

08:07.585 --> 08:11.625
Your proposal is efficient,
simple, and innovative.

08:11.705 --> 08:13.465
It has completely exceeded
our expectations.

08:13.545 --> 08:16.825
The most impressive thing about it
is that you've compiled

08:16.905 --> 08:20.105
such a systematic supplier database
for our project.

08:20.865 --> 08:22.665
The standard of Lime is indeed impressive.

08:24.625 --> 08:25.825
You're right.

08:27.225 --> 08:28.785
Before I came here,

08:28.865 --> 08:29.465
WAN JUN, YUETENG'S REPRESENTATIVE

08:29.545 --> 08:31.985
I heard Mr. Luan from Lime
has the "Hand of God."

08:32.825 --> 08:34.105
I've finally known
the meaning of the phrase

08:34.185 --> 08:35.505
"speed is the essence of war" today.

08:35.585 --> 08:36.425
I'm impressed.

08:39.185 --> 08:40.505
I'm not the only one in Lime.

08:41.105 --> 08:42.585
There are also many outstanding employees.

08:42.664 --> 08:44.985
The prototype of this database
you see here

08:45.065 --> 08:47.665
was spearheaded by Flora,

08:48.625 --> 08:49.825
who recently joined the team.

08:52.745 --> 08:54.945
Mr. Luan, not only are you capable,

08:55.025 --> 08:56.225
but your management skills
are also top-notch.

08:57.025 --> 09:00.305
Since we have a strong
supplier database to back us up,

09:00.985 --> 09:03.465
the annual framework
that we talked about previously

09:03.985 --> 09:04.985
can also proceed.

09:05.065 --> 09:06.265
Great.

09:06.345 --> 09:08.265
I'll get the legal department
to draft a contract right away.

09:08.345 --> 09:09.505
Right, Luke?

09:10.065 --> 09:11.225
You can arrange it.

09:18.385 --> 09:19.625
Thank you very much.

09:19.705 --> 09:20.785
To a great partnership.

09:20.865 --> 09:22.345
-Thank you.
-To a great partnership.

09:22.425 --> 09:23.625
Take care.

09:28.625 --> 09:30.065
As expected of you, Luke.

09:30.145 --> 09:31.105
You got the client successfully.

09:33.105 --> 09:35.905
Flora, you've also been outstanding today.

09:35.985 --> 09:39.665
You completed the initial phase
of the supplier database alone.

09:39.745 --> 09:41.905
It's not something you can do
with just a few clicks of the mouse.

09:42.865 --> 09:45.505
It requires strong logical thinking
and data analysis skills.

09:46.225 --> 09:47.625
Not bad.

09:47.705 --> 09:49.105
You are quite the talent.

09:49.185 --> 09:52.265
My boss taught me well,
and my colleagues helped me a lot.

09:54.425 --> 09:59.265
Does the HRBP only praise people
without giving any actual reward?

10:00.065 --> 10:02.025
No need. It's what I should do.

10:02.105 --> 10:03.425
Why not?

10:03.505 --> 10:05.105
Do you not want to become
a senior account executive?

10:07.585 --> 10:09.625
It's possible for you to become an SAE.

10:10.225 --> 10:11.265
However, the company policy states

10:11.345 --> 10:13.665
that you need the signature
and recommendation from your superior.

10:13.745 --> 10:17.385
Do you want Luke or Alex
to be your referrer?

10:21.625 --> 10:23.345
I'll go with the boss's decision.

10:25.745 --> 10:26.625
‎Tracy.

10:34.025 --> 10:34.945
I see.

10:38.305 --> 10:40.785
Luke, let's talk in the office.

10:40.865 --> 10:41.825
Sure.

10:49.265 --> 10:52.585
There's a very tricky problem now.

10:53.665 --> 10:54.785
What is it?

10:56.265 --> 10:57.345
How should we celebrate this?

11:00.025 --> 11:01.105
Anything is fine.

11:09.705 --> 11:12.145
I thought today's meeting
was interesting enough.

11:12.225 --> 11:15.385
I didn't expect to see
something even more interesting.

11:18.545 --> 11:19.425
LIME'S SENIOR EXECUTIVE
FOOLS AROUND WITH MULTIPLE WOMEN

11:19.505 --> 11:20.425
MISTREATING HIS EX, CAUSING HER
TO COMMIT SUICIDE, ACCUSED PARTY: LUKE

11:22.225 --> 11:23.585
These are obviously photoshopped.

11:28.545 --> 11:29.665
I don't have this weird habit.

11:31.145 --> 11:33.065
Moreover, my body is in better shape.

11:33.145 --> 11:36.465
Mr. Luan, can't you see the objective

11:36.545 --> 11:40.865
of slandering you using your private life
at a time like this?

11:42.905 --> 11:45.025
Who received this besides you?

11:47.185 --> 11:49.145
I asked our colleagues at the IT division
to run a check.

11:49.225 --> 11:51.265
30% of our colleagues
received it, at least.

11:51.345 --> 11:53.105
They include all senior executives.

11:55.465 --> 11:57.705
Tell me. How do you plan to settle this?

12:03.705 --> 12:05.065
Find three of my exes

12:05.145 --> 12:08.145
and send them a few emails
to prove that this isn't me.

12:11.025 --> 12:12.385
If you don't settle this properly,

12:12.465 --> 12:14.905
I'll have no choice but to get help
from the internal audit and legal teams.

12:18.385 --> 12:19.225
I agree.

12:19.945 --> 12:22.025
Draft an email as soon as possible
and send it to the board.

12:22.105 --> 12:23.985
Request the group
to send down an investigation unit

12:24.585 --> 12:25.545
to investigate this immediately.

12:25.625 --> 12:27.905
If my reputation is damaged,

12:28.665 --> 12:30.145
the company will sue if need be.

12:31.785 --> 12:35.065
Even if you are innocent,
the employee satisfaction survey

12:35.145 --> 12:37.105
is also an important part
before your appointment.

12:37.705 --> 12:40.985
I hope you prioritize this aspect as well.

12:42.185 --> 12:43.825
What must come will come.

12:43.905 --> 12:46.745
Instead of waiting passively,
why not make the first move?

12:51.265 --> 12:52.345
Did you send the email?

12:52.425 --> 12:54.665
It was not me. I didn't send it.

12:55.185 --> 12:56.145
Not you?

12:56.225 --> 12:57.945
Are you that naive?

12:58.545 --> 12:59.785
Who do you think Luan Nian is?

12:59.865 --> 13:02.625
Do you think some tasteless scandals
can bring him down?

13:04.145 --> 13:06.025
Mr. Lin will soon be transferred
to the US headquarters.

13:07.665 --> 13:09.985
-Do you know that?
-Do I know that?

13:11.025 --> 13:12.985
Last week, at the executives' meeting,

13:13.065 --> 13:16.065
Mr. Lin already submitted
his handover plan,

13:16.145 --> 13:17.865
yet you're still asking me if I know that?

13:17.945 --> 13:19.665
I'm asking you about that email
about Luan Nian.

13:19.745 --> 13:22.025
-Are you a fool?
-Are you a fool?

13:23.305 --> 13:24.985
Once Mr. Lin leaves,
who will take over his position?

13:26.345 --> 13:29.865
Why do you think Luan Nian
spent so much effort

13:29.945 --> 13:30.785
doing the suppliers' database?

13:30.865 --> 13:34.305
He's showing the higher-ups
that he can manage systematically.

13:34.385 --> 13:35.265
So?

13:35.905 --> 13:37.185
When you pull such a big stunt,

13:37.265 --> 13:39.265
they'll still trace it back to me
in the end.

13:39.345 --> 13:41.185
How can I compete for Mr. Lin's position?

13:43.345 --> 13:46.265
It's like putting a knife to my throat
by giving him the perfect weapon.

13:46.345 --> 13:49.945
Du Anni, are you mad,
or do you think I no longer want this?

13:52.385 --> 13:54.585
Fine. Don't worry.

13:55.305 --> 13:59.585
If something happens,
I'll make sure you won't be implicated.

14:12.145 --> 14:14.145
-No way.
-Seriously?

14:15.505 --> 14:16.945
That is crazy.

14:17.025 --> 14:18.185
-Yes.
-There are pictures too.

14:18.265 --> 14:19.545
-It can't be fake.
-Flora.

14:19.625 --> 14:20.465
Flora.

14:21.865 --> 14:22.945
Did you receive the email?

14:23.745 --> 14:24.665
You didn't?

14:25.785 --> 14:27.345
Quick. Come here, quickly.

14:34.985 --> 14:36.145
LIME'S SENIOR EXECUTIVE
FOOLS AROUND WITH MULTIPLE WOMEN

14:36.225 --> 14:37.705
I'M ZHANG XIN, EX-GIRLFRIEND OF LUAN NIAN
LIME'S DIRECTOR IN CHINA

14:42.985 --> 14:44.025
I'm going back first.

15:06.345 --> 15:07.785
Lumi.

15:07.865 --> 15:09.305
I've been looking all over for you.

15:09.385 --> 15:10.665
I just came out for some fresh air.

15:14.385 --> 15:15.505
Even you know about it?

15:18.145 --> 15:18.985
Don't believe in it.

15:19.065 --> 15:20.785
This woman used to harass me too.

15:21.785 --> 15:24.385
She called me from overseas
and investigated my background thoroughly.

15:24.465 --> 15:26.425
She even knows
where my parents are staying.

15:26.505 --> 15:28.785
She also harassed other colleagues
and clients.

15:28.865 --> 15:30.105
She's just crazy.

15:30.185 --> 15:31.945
She also sent videos. Seriously.

15:32.025 --> 15:34.305
Is Luke a fool or what?

15:34.385 --> 15:36.425
Why did he date a woman like this?

15:37.585 --> 15:40.305
Do you have the video? Show me.

15:46.585 --> 15:48.945
I know Luan Nian isn't the violent sort.

15:49.025 --> 15:49.865
But…

15:50.665 --> 15:52.425
His name will never be cleared.

15:58.705 --> 15:59.985
Actually, I was there that day.

16:01.105 --> 16:03.305
You were there? Why?

16:03.385 --> 16:07.145
I wanted to buy Luke a meal to thank him,
so I went there.

16:07.905 --> 16:09.825
Tell me what happened that day.

16:10.585 --> 16:11.705
It's a long story.

16:11.785 --> 16:12.865
Don't tell me.

16:12.945 --> 16:14.625
Tell the investigation unit directly.

16:15.385 --> 16:16.665
I'll go with you.

16:16.745 --> 16:18.705
When this woman harassed me,
I had a grudge with her.

16:18.785 --> 16:22.385
So, I kept a record of her spam calls
and emails.

16:22.465 --> 16:24.345
Let's go and become
Luke's witnesses together.

16:34.905 --> 16:36.305
They are from the headquarters.

16:36.385 --> 16:37.665
They are probably here
because of this incident.

16:38.345 --> 16:39.385
Tracy.

16:40.545 --> 16:42.065
Lisa. Take them to the meeting room first.

16:42.145 --> 16:43.785
-All right.
-This way, please.

16:44.705 --> 16:45.905
Why are you two here?

16:45.985 --> 16:47.105
We want to become Luke's witnesses.

16:47.185 --> 16:49.145
-What witness?
-The email.

16:49.905 --> 16:52.105
Regarding this,
Luke specifically mentioned

16:52.185 --> 16:54.025
that he didn't want anyone else
to get involved.

16:54.105 --> 16:58.145
Tracy, is this serious?

16:58.905 --> 16:59.745
Don't worry.

16:59.825 --> 17:01.025
The company will deal with it properly.

17:01.625 --> 17:02.865
Go back and wait for updates.

17:02.945 --> 17:03.785
Remember.

17:03.865 --> 17:05.025
Don't ever get yourself involved in this.

17:06.265 --> 17:07.105
I'm going to work.

17:18.625 --> 17:20.665
Perhaps Luke does have a plan.

17:22.825 --> 17:24.585
Let's wait and see.

17:24.665 --> 17:28.625
If we can't attest for him,
we can still think of some other ways.

17:31.665 --> 17:33.865
What kind of person
do you think Luan Nian is?

17:36.345 --> 17:37.385
He's strict.

17:37.465 --> 17:41.625
He's a little heartless,
but he is indeed talented.

17:41.705 --> 17:43.625
Strict. Professional. Serious.

17:43.705 --> 17:45.225
A very good leader.

17:45.785 --> 17:46.625
His flaws…

17:47.745 --> 17:49.145
He gets too much attention from women.

17:49.225 --> 17:53.505
Have you seen him
acting overly intimate with others?

17:53.585 --> 17:56.025
I don't think so.

17:56.105 --> 17:57.105
I'm not sure.

17:57.705 --> 17:58.625
Never.

17:58.705 --> 18:02.385
Do you know anything
about Luan Nian's ex-girlfriend?

18:03.465 --> 18:05.305
How would I know about his private life?

18:05.385 --> 18:06.465
No.

18:06.545 --> 18:08.905
Do you think Luan Nian
has a violent tendency?

18:08.985 --> 18:10.705
-No.
-Of course not.

18:12.065 --> 18:14.065
Do the silent treatment
and being controlling count?

18:18.345 --> 18:19.225
I'm not sure.

18:29.665 --> 18:32.465
Let's skip the pleasantries
and go straight to the point.

18:33.105 --> 18:35.105
Tracy mentioned you would like
to clear something up.

18:38.505 --> 18:39.385
It isn't a clarification per se.

18:43.705 --> 18:45.185
Everyone, you can look at this.

18:45.265 --> 18:47.025
This isn't just an email sent to everyone.

18:47.105 --> 18:47.945
SENDING METHOD: BCC

18:48.025 --> 18:52.425
The sender used the BCC function
and added every receiver manually.

18:52.505 --> 18:53.825
What does this mean?

18:53.905 --> 18:55.825
It means two things. One.

18:55.905 --> 18:58.385
The sender knows the internal
staff organization of Lime clearly.

18:58.465 --> 19:00.385
That is why the person
can choose the recipients precisely.

19:01.105 --> 19:03.865
Two. She deliberately avoided using BCC

19:03.945 --> 19:06.185
and hid the list of all recipients

19:06.265 --> 19:08.505
to prevent me from finding
the source of the leak.

19:09.865 --> 19:14.225
But it is also possible that you leaked
this information to your ex-girlfriend.

19:16.345 --> 19:17.225
You are right.

19:18.625 --> 19:21.185
However, among the recipients
of this email,

19:21.265 --> 19:24.785
there are 11 new employees
who joined less than a year ago.

19:24.865 --> 19:27.385
I broke up with my ex-girlfriend
more than a year ago.

19:27.465 --> 19:30.385
She would never get the email addresses
of these new employees.

19:45.185 --> 19:47.705
Is your dad crazy?

19:47.785 --> 19:50.145
We already opened for business, and now
he wants to take back the property.

19:50.225 --> 19:52.025
My dad doesn't allow me to run a bar.

19:52.105 --> 19:53.185
Why didn't he say this earlier?

19:53.265 --> 19:56.345
If the bar closes down,
all the money we invested will be gone.

19:56.425 --> 19:58.785
My savings don't fall from the sky.

19:58.865 --> 19:59.785
Will your dad compensate me?

20:00.385 --> 20:01.945
Why don't you go talk to my father?

20:02.025 --> 20:03.585
Hey, that's your dad.

20:03.665 --> 20:06.665
I… I can't believe dictatorship
still exists at this time and age.

20:10.785 --> 20:13.145
Luan Nian, isn't your father
and his father best buddies?

20:13.225 --> 20:14.425
Go and talk to him.

20:15.865 --> 20:19.025
Can you two think before you speak?

20:19.105 --> 20:20.905
Asking Luan Nian to talk to his father?

20:20.985 --> 20:22.425
Your bar will close down even sooner.

20:22.505 --> 20:24.025
Exactly. What a terrible idea.

20:24.105 --> 20:26.385
His father and my father
are always on the same page.

20:26.465 --> 20:27.625
Exactly.

20:27.705 --> 20:29.025
Enough. Let's not talk about this.

20:29.905 --> 20:31.785
I'm looking for all of you today
because I need a favor.

20:31.865 --> 20:33.745
-What's wrong?
-You didn't invest a single cent.

20:33.825 --> 20:35.185
Of course, you don't care.

20:35.265 --> 20:37.745
I can cover the equipment
and renovation fees of the bar.

20:37.825 --> 20:40.225
Find a quiet place
to reopen the bar later.

20:40.305 --> 20:42.265
Here's your sponsor daddy.

20:42.345 --> 20:43.545
-Oh my!
-Daddy.

20:44.145 --> 20:46.265
-Get lost.
-You're so generous, Daddy.

20:47.065 --> 20:48.145
Hurry up.

20:48.865 --> 20:50.385
It's your turn to help me out now.

20:50.465 --> 20:52.305
-Go to a place with me later.
-Sure.

20:52.385 --> 20:54.785
-We'll do anything for you.
-No problem.

21:08.785 --> 21:09.705
Over there.

21:09.785 --> 21:11.425
The electrical box is over there.

21:11.505 --> 21:13.185
I thought the circuit breaker
had tripped back then.

21:13.265 --> 21:16.305
After I investigated, the wires
were obviously cut by someone else.

21:17.025 --> 21:19.145
I thought it was done by some naughty kid
from the neighborhood.

21:19.825 --> 21:20.905
When the power went out,

21:21.545 --> 21:23.345
my shop's CCTV stopped recording.

21:23.425 --> 21:25.585
Moreover, I watched the video.

21:25.665 --> 21:29.545
I'm sure she already set up
the camera behind this wall

21:29.625 --> 21:31.105
and edited the captured footage.

21:31.785 --> 21:33.265
Looking at the video's angle,

21:33.345 --> 21:35.665
I'm sure she was recording from there.

21:35.745 --> 21:36.945
Yes.

21:38.905 --> 21:41.145
You two have only been together
for a few days,

21:41.705 --> 21:42.905
and she's already working
with outsiders to set you up.

21:44.105 --> 21:45.625
Do you still not get it?

21:45.705 --> 21:47.145
She was used.

21:47.225 --> 21:50.225
Otherwise, she wouldn't have found
a hidden place like mine.

21:50.825 --> 21:52.785
What is this important deal you're in?

21:52.865 --> 21:56.625
Your enemy had to go out of their way
to film the whole thing.

21:57.145 --> 22:00.745
The only benefit of this job
is that I get to stay away from my father.

22:01.265 --> 22:02.425
We don't have to investigate it.

22:03.545 --> 22:04.385
No.

22:04.945 --> 22:06.665
We must find this jerk.

22:06.745 --> 22:09.105
Even if you're quitting,
you still can't take this lying down.

22:09.185 --> 22:10.425
That's right.

22:13.785 --> 22:17.025
Tan, whose car is this?

22:17.105 --> 22:18.105
What car?

22:19.025 --> 22:20.705
It's for delivering goods
for the shop. Why?

22:20.785 --> 22:22.025
This car has a dashcam.

22:22.665 --> 22:23.985
It has always been recording.

22:24.505 --> 22:26.105
It must have recorded the whole thing.

22:26.185 --> 22:27.905
-You're really lucky.
-Come on. Let's go back to the hotel.

22:27.985 --> 22:29.465
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

22:47.185 --> 22:49.905
LUAN NIAN'S SUSPENSION NOTICE

22:51.265 --> 22:53.505
<i>After internal discussion,</i>
<i>the general manager's office</i>

22:53.585 --> 22:55.185
<i>at headquarters has decided</i>

22:55.265 --> 22:58.145
<i>that all of Luke Luan's duties</i>
<i>will be suspended from today onward</i>

22:58.225 --> 22:59.985
<i>until the investigation result</i>
<i>is released.</i>

23:00.065 --> 23:01.105
<i>During the suspension,</i>

23:01.185 --> 23:04.505
<i>all of Luke Luan's duties</i>
<i>will be temporarily handled by Alex Zhang.</i>

23:29.905 --> 23:31.985
<i>What kind of person</i>
<i>do you think Luan Nian is?</i>

23:32.585 --> 23:34.585
He is a very good leader.

23:34.665 --> 23:37.465
Although he looks aloof and cold
and unapproachable on the outside,

23:37.545 --> 23:40.545
I find him to be patient
after getting to know him.

23:41.145 --> 23:42.545
<i>Moreover, he keeps personal issues</i>
<i>separate from work.</i>

23:44.305 --> 23:45.665
<i>When he is socializing outside,</i>

23:45.745 --> 23:47.945
<i>he'll make sure</i>
<i>his female colleagues feel safe.</i>

23:48.025 --> 23:49.385
<i>He is willing to share his knowledge</i>

23:49.465 --> 23:50.785
<i>even with those</i>
<i>who are not his subordinates.</i>

23:51.465 --> 23:53.905
<i>Many people in the company, including me,</i>

23:53.985 --> 23:55.545
<i>have received his guidance.</i>

24:07.745 --> 24:08.825
Hello.

24:08.905 --> 24:09.905
Visitor needs to register…

24:11.425 --> 24:13.305
Hello. Welcome home.

24:38.905 --> 24:41.305
‎REMOTE, 10:37 PM

25:40.705 --> 25:42.185
It's the middle of the night.

25:42.265 --> 25:43.545
The neighbors will complain

25:44.065 --> 25:45.265
if you keep pressing
the doorbell like crazy.

25:49.385 --> 25:51.625
Don't you know the passcode for my door?

25:55.065 --> 25:55.905
Come in.

26:06.865 --> 26:08.105
You didn't change the passcode?

26:08.905 --> 26:10.105
Why should I?

26:14.585 --> 26:15.505
Are you all right?

26:16.585 --> 26:17.425
Not really.

26:18.345 --> 26:19.225
My face is ruined.

26:21.065 --> 26:22.025
I'm too embarrassed to see anyone.

26:23.665 --> 26:24.585
Did you…

26:24.665 --> 26:26.785
Did you fight with the people
of the investigation unit?

26:28.785 --> 26:30.625
You are really imaginative.

26:31.425 --> 26:32.305
I got nicked by a razor.

26:33.505 --> 26:35.265
All because you keep pressing
the doorbell.

26:36.385 --> 26:37.345
Do you have a band-aid?

26:37.425 --> 26:38.425
Let me put it on for you.

26:39.665 --> 26:41.105
It's in the coffee table's drawer.

27:17.545 --> 27:18.385
Forget it.

27:19.705 --> 27:20.545
It's nothing serious.

27:25.025 --> 27:27.385
Did the investigation unit
talk to you today?

27:29.665 --> 27:33.185
I came here to tell you
that I can be your witness

27:34.425 --> 27:35.585
if you want.

27:40.865 --> 27:43.825
Aren't you trying
to keep a distance from me?

27:48.385 --> 27:50.665
I know you don't want others
to get involved,

27:51.385 --> 27:52.865
but now is not the time for that.

27:54.745 --> 27:55.745
What do you mean?

27:55.825 --> 27:57.865
You've been suspended.

27:59.745 --> 28:00.945
Have you seen those pictures?

28:04.225 --> 28:05.625
You can look at them.

28:07.505 --> 28:08.585
Other people might not see the difference,

28:09.465 --> 28:11.185
but you should know
that the person isn't me.

28:17.305 --> 28:18.225
Come with me.

28:18.305 --> 28:19.265
Let me take you somewhere.

28:29.665 --> 28:30.825
Where is this?

28:32.865 --> 28:34.545
I want to open a bar in the mountains.

28:36.905 --> 28:38.265
What do you think of this place?

28:40.345 --> 28:41.745
Here?

28:43.865 --> 28:44.945
In the mountains.

28:45.945 --> 28:47.625
Something like a private bar.

28:47.705 --> 28:49.385
It'll only be open to a handful of people.

28:50.025 --> 28:51.105
Do you think it'll work?

28:57.065 --> 28:58.225
This place

29:00.305 --> 29:01.945
is good for stargazing.

29:06.705 --> 29:08.865
All right. This is the place, then.

29:10.225 --> 29:11.225
You're making a decision so casually?

29:11.305 --> 29:15.185
Then, I think this place
could use a little makeover.

29:17.665 --> 29:18.665
I'll take your advice.

29:25.345 --> 29:27.225
This place is indeed good for stargazing.

29:35.145 --> 29:37.865
Are you really leaving Lime?

29:39.465 --> 29:42.505
Is this incident that serious?

29:45.385 --> 29:47.025
I don't lose anything if Lime fires me.

29:47.105 --> 29:48.585
Lime will lose a lot, in fact.

29:51.545 --> 29:53.305
You must never leave Lime.

29:54.145 --> 29:55.185
Don't give up.

29:57.145 --> 30:00.385
Because I think you are a great teacher.

30:00.985 --> 30:02.505
I can learn a lot

30:04.105 --> 30:05.665
from you.

30:08.545 --> 30:09.465
Shang Zhitao.

30:11.265 --> 30:12.745
Isn't your desire for knowledge

30:13.825 --> 30:15.185
too strong?

30:17.385 --> 30:18.225
I…

30:19.065 --> 30:22.145
I don't want to lose the opportunity
to learn from you.

30:22.225 --> 30:24.465
Besides, I don't want
to be eliminated from Lime

30:24.985 --> 30:26.025
because of my incompetence.

30:29.825 --> 30:31.985
You might be harsh when you're teaching,

30:32.065 --> 30:33.025
but

30:33.945 --> 30:35.825
everything you've said has been useful.

30:48.425 --> 30:49.945
If I promise you that I won't leave,

30:51.945 --> 30:53.785
can you not keep your distance
from me tonight?

31:03.545 --> 31:04.385
Why are you staring at me?

31:05.305 --> 31:06.945
Am I more interesting than the stars?

32:40.145 --> 32:41.305
<i>The person who falls</i>
<i>for the other person first</i>

32:41.905 --> 32:44.305
<i>will lower all their guard</i>
<i>and lose everything.</i>

32:47.585 --> 32:48.465
<i>I know this.</i>

32:51.545 --> 32:54.905
<i>But I'm just worried</i>
<i>that this wonderful moment</i>

32:55.665 --> 32:57.305
<i>is a result of my recklessness.</i>

33:09.385 --> 33:11.345
It's too late tonight.

33:11.865 --> 33:13.505
I still have to go to work tomorrow.

33:17.785 --> 33:18.905
Let's go back first.

33:19.705 --> 33:20.585
Sure.

33:45.505 --> 33:48.105
Boss. The image verification result,

33:48.705 --> 33:49.985
the footage that shows the truth,

33:50.065 --> 33:51.905
and information about
all related people are inside.

33:53.105 --> 33:55.305
Do you want to submit it
to the investigation unit

33:55.385 --> 33:56.385
or…

34:03.825 --> 34:04.665
Why didn't you

34:05.545 --> 34:07.785
submit this to the investigation
unit yourself?

34:08.865 --> 34:09.744
No need.

34:12.865 --> 34:16.145
But Alex said he didn't do any of these.

34:16.225 --> 34:19.145
Even if he didn't, he is still implicated.

34:20.145 --> 34:22.465
If you still want
to progress further in your career,

34:23.625 --> 34:26.824
making fewer enemies isn't a bad thing.

34:29.344 --> 34:30.505
Yes.

34:30.585 --> 34:32.985
If this breach of confidence
becomes public,

34:33.065 --> 34:36.225
the consequences will be far more dire
than my scandals.

34:36.304 --> 34:38.625
It is no longer an issue
of an employee's character,

34:38.705 --> 34:41.945
but a breach of confidence
caused by internal in-fighting.

34:42.784 --> 34:45.145
When that happens,
the headquarters will punish us,

34:45.225 --> 34:47.425
and all our peers
in the advertising industry

34:47.505 --> 34:48.465
will see us as a laughingstock.

34:49.505 --> 34:51.784
Clients will even switch
to other companies

34:51.865 --> 34:53.225
because of this.

34:53.304 --> 34:54.585
It's just not worth it.

35:02.825 --> 35:04.905
Once this incident is over,

35:04.985 --> 35:07.145
the position of interim general manager
is yours.

35:08.465 --> 35:09.385
It is

35:11.025 --> 35:12.265
supposed to be yours anyway.

35:13.985 --> 35:14.825
Of course.

35:26.585 --> 35:28.745
"Following a thorough investigation
by the joint investigation team,

35:28.825 --> 35:30.305
it is proven that the allegations against

35:30.385 --> 35:32.425
Lime Advertising China's
Creative Director, Luke Luan,

35:32.505 --> 35:35.865
are false and defamatory."

35:36.385 --> 35:39.945
"Relevant details will not be disclosed
to respect the wishes of the parties.

35:40.025 --> 35:42.545
Moving forward,
Lime China's Legal Department

35:42.625 --> 35:45.345
will assist Luan Nian
in taking legal action against Zhang Xin.

35:45.425 --> 35:46.705
Notice is hereby given."

35:49.025 --> 35:50.425
"After a unanimous decision,

35:50.505 --> 35:52.505
Luan Nian will now be appointed

35:52.585 --> 35:55.185
as Lime Advertising China's
Interim General Manager."

35:57.625 --> 35:58.545
APPOINTMENT NOTICE

36:06.465 --> 36:07.385
Hello, Mr. Luan.

36:24.225 --> 36:25.425
Hello, Mr. Luan.

36:25.505 --> 36:26.425
Hello, Mr. Luan.

36:27.825 --> 36:30.945
Inform every division
to have a budget meeting in one hour.

36:31.025 --> 36:32.105
Yes.

36:33.825 --> 36:35.585
The empress has returned.

36:37.785 --> 36:39.985
Excuse me. Please wait
for a while, everyone.

36:46.985 --> 36:48.545
I have so much work to do
as soon as I come back?

36:49.545 --> 36:52.465
These documents require the signature
of a general manager.

36:52.545 --> 36:54.185
Go ahead, Mr. Luan.

36:55.145 --> 36:57.505
I've submitted Flora's promotion to SAE.

36:57.585 --> 36:58.905
Please approve it.

37:01.545 --> 37:03.665
When do you plan to move your office?

37:03.745 --> 37:05.985
Mr. Lin's office has been cleared.

37:11.625 --> 37:12.825
I won't be moving.

37:12.905 --> 37:14.025
This floor is nice.

37:14.105 --> 37:15.425
It's convenient for meetings.

37:15.505 --> 37:17.225
No problem. It's your decision.

37:18.185 --> 37:19.145
You just got appointed.

37:19.225 --> 37:21.905
The most important task
is to restructure our sales team.

37:21.985 --> 37:23.665
They are big shots in the industry.

37:23.745 --> 37:24.905
It's not easy to manage them.

37:24.985 --> 37:25.865
I've been thinking about a reformation.

37:26.705 --> 37:28.425
I'll keep you in the loop
once I come out with the proposal.

37:29.625 --> 37:33.025
Okay. But the elimination rate of the team
should still be kept at 30%.

37:33.105 --> 37:35.905
Otherwise, when the time comes
to evaluate you,

37:35.985 --> 37:36.945
don't blame me
for giving you a bad rating.

37:39.225 --> 37:40.225
Come in.

37:42.865 --> 37:46.385
Luke. Today we need to align the budget
for the project proposal meeting.

37:46.465 --> 37:48.225
I've sent all the details to your email.

37:48.305 --> 37:49.145
Okay.

37:50.025 --> 37:51.265
Who will be present in the meeting?

37:51.945 --> 37:55.105
Since you're newly appointed,
let's visit every division.

37:55.185 --> 37:56.385
Let's go.

37:58.585 --> 37:59.505
Next group.

38:05.705 --> 38:08.585
Let's first talk about the industry
seminar your division is in charge of.

38:09.945 --> 38:12.585
This year, we've decided on cities like
Beijing, Shanghai, Guangzhou, Shenzhen,

38:12.665 --> 38:14.945
Hong Kong, China, Chongqing, and Xiamen.

38:15.025 --> 38:17.425
We also want to invite clients
from various industries

38:17.505 --> 38:18.945
for a joint seminar.

38:19.025 --> 38:20.545
The objective
is client relationship management.

38:20.625 --> 38:24.305
This is also
Lime's most valued annual tradition.

38:25.665 --> 38:27.625
If it's just to maintain
a relationship with clients,

38:27.705 --> 38:29.905
taking them out for a meal and drinks
would be good enough.

38:30.505 --> 38:31.585
A 500,000-yuan budget is good enough.

38:32.345 --> 38:34.105
Why should I spend 17 million yuan

38:34.185 --> 38:36.905
to achieve something
that can be done with 500,000 yuan?

38:41.585 --> 38:42.745
How do you plan to adjust it?

38:43.745 --> 38:45.585
Unless you have a concrete idea,

38:45.665 --> 38:48.145
my suggestion is to remove it completely.

38:56.545 --> 38:58.625
Mr. Luan, what about this?

38:58.705 --> 39:01.905
I'll go back and study more
about this project with my team.

39:01.985 --> 39:05.865
Actually, managing client relationships
is just a small part of this project.

39:05.945 --> 39:09.185
Making an impact in the industry
is also very important.

39:10.185 --> 39:11.785
Besides the list of clients,

39:11.865 --> 39:12.905
what kind of experts can you invite,

39:12.985 --> 39:14.385
and how many potential clients
can you bring?

39:16.425 --> 39:18.145
Study it carefully
before we decide if we want it.

39:22.545 --> 39:24.225
Alex, is that okay with you?

39:28.025 --> 39:29.065
Of course.

39:32.665 --> 39:33.705
What about you, Annie?

39:35.905 --> 39:37.745
Whatever you say.

39:39.345 --> 39:40.185
All right.

39:40.785 --> 39:43.385
I'll have to trouble all of you
to revise everything.

39:43.465 --> 39:45.825
Every budget
will be discussed again tomorrow.

39:45.905 --> 39:47.465
My request is simple.

39:47.545 --> 39:51.145
Think it through
before you decide on doing something.

39:51.225 --> 39:53.385
Once everyone agrees on the core progress,

39:53.465 --> 39:54.705
make sure to report back.

39:55.865 --> 39:59.025
There must be a solution
to every problem you encounter.

39:59.105 --> 40:00.425
Okay?

40:03.185 --> 40:05.305
Mr. Luan is asking
if all of you are okay with it.

40:07.585 --> 40:09.905
-Who is doing the meeting minutes?
-I am.

40:09.985 --> 40:11.585
After the meeting,

40:11.665 --> 40:13.505
send it to everyone
who is in this meeting and CC me.

40:13.585 --> 40:14.425
Okay.

40:18.705 --> 40:20.985
He sure makes full use
of his first day of work.

40:21.065 --> 40:23.425
Be careful. Mind your attitude.

40:23.505 --> 40:25.305
We are talking about more than
10 million yuan. How should I react?

40:26.305 --> 40:27.865
Everyone, gather around.

40:33.265 --> 40:34.505
I have an announcement to make.

40:34.585 --> 40:37.065
There'll be a friendly
basketball match with Yueteng.

40:37.145 --> 40:39.585
It won't be considered as your KPI
or your job.

40:39.665 --> 40:40.705
Which division can handle it?

40:40.785 --> 40:42.465
Who wants to take charge?

40:49.345 --> 40:50.705
I can do it.

40:55.185 --> 40:56.385
Okay.

40:56.465 --> 40:58.465
I'll leave it to you. Thank you.

41:23.865 --> 41:24.705
Feeling vindicated?

41:26.185 --> 41:27.025
Do you feel vindicated?

41:28.505 --> 41:29.465
Yes.

41:30.225 --> 41:32.985
Actually, I received
Luke's email last night.

41:33.705 --> 41:36.265
He told me he would initiate
the project budget meeting

41:36.345 --> 41:37.665
and the project evaluation today.

41:37.745 --> 41:39.385
I got it immediately.

41:40.025 --> 41:42.385
I was sure that he solved everything.

41:43.385 --> 41:44.505
But this morning,

41:45.105 --> 41:48.705
I still felt excited
when I received this email.

41:48.785 --> 41:49.825
It felt so good.

41:52.425 --> 41:54.825
Lumi, what project evaluation?

41:54.905 --> 41:56.905
Can I join?

41:56.985 --> 41:59.585
Because I want to become
an independent project manager.

41:59.665 --> 42:01.145
Doing this helps gather experience.

42:01.225 --> 42:02.865
No, Shang Zhitao.

42:02.945 --> 42:05.225
Are you even normal?

42:05.305 --> 42:07.465
Why do you like to work so much?

42:09.345 --> 42:12.225
If you want to do it,
go and ask the boss directly.

42:12.825 --> 42:15.385
He is now the general manager.

42:15.465 --> 42:16.865
General manager.

42:17.945 --> 42:18.905
Go for it.

42:21.425 --> 42:22.505
Lumi.

42:23.745 --> 42:27.145
You are so capable,
and you can do everything well.

42:27.225 --> 42:31.345
Why don't you request
to handle a project all by yourself?

42:32.185 --> 42:33.865
Handling a project all by myself?

42:33.945 --> 42:36.585
Forget it. I'm already tired enough.

42:37.865 --> 42:41.145
I'm working because I just
want something to do.

42:42.105 --> 42:43.465
I have Luke to cover me.

42:43.545 --> 42:46.225
I'm grateful to the competitive Luke

42:46.305 --> 42:48.225
for letting me achieve great things
by doing nothing.

42:52.305 --> 42:53.825
He is quite a hard worker.

42:53.905 --> 42:55.305
If he doesn't work hard,

42:55.385 --> 43:00.385
how can he manage such a big team
in the advertising industry?

43:03.345 --> 43:07.185
Everything is good about him,

43:07.785 --> 43:10.345
but you must never fall for him.

43:11.785 --> 43:13.545
Why not?

43:14.145 --> 43:16.785
He has a really bad temper.

43:18.065 --> 43:20.945
Even someone as experienced as me

43:21.025 --> 43:23.425
will probably be brokenhearted
and shed tears because of him.

43:25.225 --> 43:28.785
However, I don't mind being friends

43:29.465 --> 43:31.345
with someone as handsome as him.

43:33.025 --> 43:34.865
Tracy, you're right.

43:34.945 --> 43:36.905
You run your mouth like a train.

43:37.985 --> 43:39.625
I'm the high-speed rail.
